From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:14:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll-unix: port virtual_ios.c onto wine-11.18 thread data
 and pe_mapping_info

Upstream's diff applied hunk-wise (53 of 61 clean); rejects resolved by hand:
TEB/thread-data allocation taken from 11.18 with the iOS shared-user-data
relocation and ml952 window; set_large_address_space keeps the address_space_start
reset and ml990 clamp; free_reserved_memory keeps the FEX-arena guard; the
macOS fixed host VA limit is kept off iOS.

Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-26-wine-latest-rebase.md
Offered-upstream: no
